---
const researchTopics = [
	'population',
	'movement',
	'health',
	'traffic',
	'waste',
	'vaccination',
	'identification',
	'planning',
];
---

<!doctype html>
<html lang="en">
	<head>
		<meta charset="utf-8" />
		<link rel="icon" type="image/svg+xml" href="/favicon.svg" />
		<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1" />
		<meta
			name="description"
			content="WATFA is a community-sourced open dataset of street dogs and cats in Guwahati."
		/>
		<meta name="theme-color" content="#f3efe5" />
		<meta property="og:title" content="WATFA — Where are the free agents?" />
		<meta property="og:description" content="A public record of Guwahati's street dogs and cats." />
		<meta property="og:type" content="website" />
		<title>WATFA — Where are the free agents?</title>
	</head>
	<body>
		<a class="skip-link" href="#overview">Skip to overview</a>

		<div class="site">
			<header>
				<a class="brand" href="#top" aria-label="WATFA, back to top">
					<svg viewBox="0 0 42 42" aria-hidden="true">
						<circle cx="12" cy="11" r="4"></circle>
						<circle cx="21" cy="7" r="4"></circle>
						<circle cx="30" cy="11" r="4"></circle>
						<path d="M11 27c0-7 4-12 10-12s10 5 10 12c0 5-4 8-10 8s-10-3-10-8Z"></path>
					</svg>
					<strong>WATFA</strong>
				</a>
				<p>Where are the free agents?</p>
				<nav aria-label="Main navigation">
					<a href="#overview">The idea</a>
					<a href="#help">Help</a>
				</nav>
			</header>

			<main id="top">
				<section class="hero" aria-labelledby="hero-title">
					<div class="hero-copy">
						<p class="kicker">Where are the free agents? · Guwahati</p>
						<h1 id="hero-title">
							<strong>WATFA</strong> is a community-sourced public dataset of street dogs and cats. It
							creates a shared, ongoing record of the free agents who live across our neighbourhoods,
							beginning in Guwahati.
						</h1>
						<div class="hero-bottom">
							<p>
								Collection can happen through forms, bots, a website or an app. What matters is the
								shared dataset and the process for continuously maintaining it.
							</p>
						</div>
					</div>

					<aside class="hero-how" aria-labelledby="how-title">
						<div class="card-head"><span>01 / Process</span><i>↘</i></div>
						<h2 id="how-title">How it works</h2>
						<ol>
							<li><span>01</span><strong>Survey</strong><small>Volunteers regularly cover their neighbourhoods; anyone can add an ad-hoc sighting.</small></li>
							<li><span>02</span><strong>Record</strong><small>Add a photo, time, approximate location and useful health or vaccination notes.</small></li>
							<li><span>03</span><strong>Match</strong><small>Connect likely repeated sightings to an individual animal profile where possible.</small></li>
							<li><span>04</span><strong>Follow</strong><small>See where and when an animal appears, and how they change over weeks, months and years.</small></li>
						</ol>
						<p class="how-note">Matches can stay fuzzy, using shape, features, markings and other visual or non-visual attributes.</p>
					</aside>
				</section>

				<section class="lost-section" id="overview" aria-labelledby="lost-title">
					<div class="lost-copy">
						<div class="card-head"><span>02 / Lost · Found · Relocated</span><i>•••</i></div>
						<h2 id="lost-title">Turn a chance sighting into a possible match.</h2>
						<p>
							A missing report in Chandmari and a casual sighting on Zoo Road may be the same animal.
							WATFA can flag the possible match and preserve a timeline beyond one poster or post.
						</p>
					</div>
					<div class="lost-match" aria-hidden="true">
						<div><small>Missing</small><strong>Chandmari</strong></div>
						<span><i></i><i></i><i></i></span>
						<div><small>Sighting</small><strong>Zoo Road</strong></div>
					</div>
				</section>

				<section class="poster-grid" aria-label="More ways WATFA can help">
					<article class="card card-search">
						<div class="card-head"><span>03</span><i>▦</i></div>
						<h2>Search together</h2>
						<p>
							A local team can spread the word during the crucial first week, put up weather-resistant
							posters, coordinate streets and watch for several missing animals at once.
						</p>
						<ul class="tags">
							<li>Local know-how</li><li>Shared notes</li><li>Drone imagery</li><li>Better next time</li>
						</ul>
					</article>

					<article class="card card-research">
						<div class="card-head"><span>04</span><i>◎</i></div>
						<h2>Research</h2>
						<p>
							Long-running observations can help communities, researchers, civic bodies and welfare
							groups understand:
						</p>
						<ul class="topic-list">
							{researchTopics.map((topic) => <li>{topic}</li>)}
						</ul>
						<div class="research-caution">
							<strong>Read with care.</strong>
							<span>Community observations have sampling bias. Record survey effort, missing data and confidence levels. Obscure sensitive locations. This is useful evidence, not an official count.</span>
						</div>
						<div class="ring" aria-hidden="true"></div>
					</article>

					<article class="card card-help" id="help">
						<div class="card-head"><span>05</span><i>☰</i></div>
						<h2>How to help</h2>
						<dl>
							<div><dt>Donate</dt><dd>Infrastructure, experiments and fieldwork.</dd></div>
							<div><dt>Develop</dt><dd>Collection, matching, mapping and search tools. Our one developer wants friends.</dd></div>
							<div><dt>Volunteer</dt><dd>Survey, photograph, contribute and spread the word.</dd></div>
						</dl>
					</article>

					<article class="card card-privacy">
						<div class="card-head"><span>06</span><i>⌗</i></div>
						<h2>Animal privacy</h2>
						<p>
							Precise locations help research and identification, but can also help thieves, smugglers
							or people trying to harm or illegally relocate animals. Public locations should stay
							<strong>deliberately fuzzy</strong> and evolve as we learn.
						</p>
						<div class="privacy-mark" aria-hidden="true"><i></i><i></i><i></i><i></i><b></b></div>
					</article>
				</section>
			</main>

			<footer>
				<strong>WATFA</strong>
				<p>Community-sourced · Open public dataset · Guwahati</p>
				<a href="#top">Back to top ↑</a>
			</footer>
		</div>
	</body>
</html>

<style>
	:root {
		--ink: #101010;
		--paper: #f3efe5;
		--blue: #174fe9;
		--orange: #ff3d18;
		--lime: #b7ef00;
		--pink: #ed4aa8;
		--yellow: #ffbd16;
		--purple: #291257;
		--line: 1px solid var(--ink);
		--sans: "Helvetica Neue", Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;
		--mono: "SFMono-Regular", Consolas, monospace;
	}

	* { box-sizing: border-box; }

	html {
		scroll-behavior: smooth;
		background: var(--ink);
	}

	body {
		margin: 0;
		background: var(--ink);
		color: var(--ink);
		font-family: var(--sans);
		-webkit-font-smoothing: antialiased;
	}

	a { color: inherit; }
	p, h1, h2, ol, ul, dl, dd { margin-top: 0; }
	::selection { background: var(--pink); }

	.skip-link {
		position: fixed;
		top: 8px;
		left: 8px;
		z-index: 100;
		padding: 8px 12px;
		background: white;
		font: 700 0.7rem var(--mono);
		transform: translateY(-150%);
	}

	.skip-link:focus { transform: translateY(0); }

	.site {
		width: min(100% - 32px, 1440px);
		margin: 16px auto;
		background: var(--paper);
		border: var(--line);
	}

	header {
		display: grid;
		height: 62px;
		grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr 1fr;
		align-items: center;
		border-bottom: var(--line);
	}

	header > * {
		height: 100%;
		margin: 0;
		padding: 0 18px;
		border-right: var(--line);
	}

	header > *:last-child { border-right: 0; }

	.brand {
		display: flex;
		align-items: center;
		gap: 10px;
		font-size: 1.25rem;
		letter-spacing: -0.05em;
		text-decoration: none;
	}

	.brand svg {
		width: 34px;
		height: 34px;
		padding: 6px;
		background: var(--orange);
		border-radius: 50%;
		fill: var(--ink);
	}

	header > p {
		display: flex;
		align-items: center;
		font: 700 0.63rem var(--mono);
		text-transform: uppercase;
	}

	nav {
		display: flex;
		align-items: center;
		justify-content: flex-end;
		gap: 24px;
	}

	nav a,
	footer a {
		font: 700 0.62rem var(--mono);
		text-transform: uppercase;
		text-underline-offset: 4px;
	}

	.hero {
		display: grid;
		height: calc(65svh - 80px);
		min-height: 440px;
		grid-template-columns: 1.22fr 0.78fr;
		border-bottom: var(--line);
	}

	.hero-copy {
		display: flex;
		min-width: 0;
		flex-direction: column;
		justify-content: space-between;
		padding: clamp(24px, 3.5vw, 52px);
		border-right: var(--line);
	}

	.kicker,
	.card-head {
		font: 700 0.62rem/1.35 var(--mono);
		letter-spacing: 0.04em;
		text-transform: uppercase;
	}

	.hero h1 {
		margin: auto 0;
		max-width: 760px;
		font-size: clamp(1.8rem, 3vw, 3.1rem);
		font-weight: 500;
		letter-spacing: -0.045em;
		line-height: 1.02;
	}

	.hero h1 strong {
		color: var(--blue);
		font-weight: 900;
	}

	.hero-bottom {
		padding-top: 18px;
		border-top: var(--line);
	}

	.hero-bottom p {
		max-width: 600px;
		margin: 0;
		font-size: clamp(0.76rem, 1vw, 0.9rem);
		line-height: 1.45;
	}

	.hero-how {
		display: flex;
		min-width: 0;
		flex-direction: column;
		padding: clamp(20px, 2.4vw, 34px);
		background: var(--blue);
		color: white;
	}

	.hero-how h2,
	.lost-section h2 {
		margin-bottom: 18px;
		font-size: clamp(2rem, 3.5vw, 3.8rem);
		font-weight: 900;
		letter-spacing: -0.065em;
		line-height: 0.92;
		text-transform: uppercase;
	}

	.hero-how ol {
		display: grid;
		grid-template-columns: 1fr;
		margin: 0;
		padding: 0;
		border-top: 1px solid white;
		border-left: 1px solid white;
		list-style: none;
	}

	.hero-how li {
		display: grid;
		grid-template-columns: 26px 70px 1fr;
		gap: 10px;
		align-items: start;
		padding: clamp(9px, 1.3vw, 15px);
		border-right: 1px solid white;
		border-bottom: 1px solid white;
	}

	.hero-how li span {
		font: 700 0.55rem var(--mono);
		color: var(--lime);
	}

	.hero-how li strong {
		font-size: 0.82rem;
		text-transform: uppercase;
	}

	.hero-how li small {
		font-size: 0.66rem;
		line-height: 1.3;
	}

	.how-note {
		margin: auto 0 0;
		padding: 10px 12px;
		background: var(--lime);
		border: var(--line);
		color: var(--ink);
		font: 700 0.58rem/1.35 var(--mono);
		text-transform: uppercase;
	}

	.lost-section {
		display: grid;
		height: 32svh;
		min-height: 270px;
		grid-template-columns: 1.15fr 0.85fr;
		background: var(--orange);
		border-bottom: var(--line);
		scroll-margin-top: 10px;
	}

	.lost-copy {
		padding: clamp(20px, 2.5vw, 36px);
		border-right: var(--line);
	}

	.lost-section h2 {
		max-width: 760px;
		margin-bottom: 14px;
	}

	.lost-copy > p {
		max-width: 710px;
		margin: 0;
		font-size: clamp(0.78rem, 1vw, 0.92rem);
		line-height: 1.45;
	}

	.lost-match {
		display: flex;
		align-items: center;
		padding: clamp(20px, 2.5vw, 36px);
		background: var(--paper);
	}

	.lost-match > div {
		display: flex;
		width: clamp(90px, 11vw, 140px);
		aspect-ratio: 1;
		flex: 0 0 auto;
		flex-direction: column;
		align-items: center;
		justify-content: center;
		background: var(--orange);
		border: var(--line);
		border-radius: 50%;
		text-align: center;
	}

	.lost-match > div:last-child { background: var(--blue); color: white; }
	.lost-match small { font: 700 0.52rem var(--mono); text-transform: uppercase; }
	.lost-match strong { font-size: clamp(0.7rem, 1vw, 0.9rem); }

	.lost-match > span {
		display: flex;
		min-width: 45px;
		flex: 1;
		align-items: center;
		justify-content: space-around;
		border-top: var(--line);
	}

	.lost-match > span i {
		width: 7px;
		height: 7px;
		background: var(--paper);
		border: var(--line);
		border-radius: 50%;
		transform: translateY(-50%);
	}

	.poster-grid {
		display: grid;
		height: 58svh;
		min-height: 480px;
		grid-template-columns: repeat(2, minmax(0, 1fr));
		grid-template-rows: repeat(2, minmax(0, 1fr));
		scroll-margin-top: 10px;
	}

	.card {
		position: relative;
		min-width: 0;
		padding: clamp(13px, 1.35vw, 20px);
		border-right: var(--line);
		border-bottom: var(--line);
		overflow: hidden;
	}

	.card:nth-child(2n) { border-right: 0; }
	.card:nth-child(n + 3) { border-bottom: 0; }

	.card-head {
		display: flex;
		justify-content: space-between;
		margin-bottom: clamp(8px, 1.2vh, 14px);
	}

	.card-head i {
		font-family: var(--sans);
		font-size: 0.85rem;
		font-style: normal;
	}

	.card h2 {
		position: relative;
		z-index: 2;
		margin-bottom: clamp(7px, 1vh, 12px);
		font-size: clamp(1.45rem, 2.25vw, 2.4rem);
		font-weight: 900;
		letter-spacing: -0.06em;
		line-height: 0.95;
		text-transform: uppercase;
	}

	.card p,
	.card li,
	.card dd {
		position: relative;
		z-index: 2;
		font-size: clamp(0.67rem, 0.8vw, 0.78rem);
		line-height: 1.38;
	}

	.card p { margin-bottom: 8px; }
	.card strong { font-weight: 800; }

	.card-search { background: var(--paper); }

	.tags,
	.topic-list {
		position: relative;
		z-index: 2;
		display: flex;
		flex-wrap: wrap;
		gap: 5px;
		margin: 10px 0 0;
		padding: 0;
		list-style: none;
	}

	.tags li,
	.topic-list li {
		padding: 3px 6px;
		border: var(--line);
		font: 700 0.5rem var(--mono);
		text-transform: uppercase;
	}

	.card-research {
		background: var(--blue);
		color: white;
	}

	.topic-list { max-width: 68%; }
	.topic-list li { border-color: white; }

	.research-caution {
		position: absolute;
		right: 0;
		bottom: 0;
		left: 0;
		z-index: 3;
		display: grid;
		grid-template-columns: auto 1fr;
		gap: 12px;
		align-items: start;
		padding: 10px clamp(13px, 1.35vw, 20px);
		background: var(--lime);
		border-top: 1px solid white;
		color: var(--ink);
	}

	.research-caution strong {
		font-size: 0.74rem;
		text-transform: uppercase;
	}

	.research-caution span {
		font-size: clamp(0.58rem, 0.7vw, 0.68rem);
		line-height: 1.3;
	}

	.ring {
		position: absolute;
		right: -8%;
		bottom: -18%;
		width: 44%;
		aspect-ratio: 1;
		border: 17px solid var(--lime);
		border-radius: 50%;
	}

	.card-help { scroll-margin-top: 10px; }

	.card-help dl { margin-bottom: 0; }

	.card-help dl > div {
		display: grid;
		grid-template-columns: 64px 1fr;
		gap: 8px;
		padding: 5px 0;
		border-top: var(--line);
	}

	.card-help dt {
		font-size: clamp(0.68rem, 0.8vw, 0.8rem);
		font-weight: 800;
		text-transform: uppercase;
	}

	.card-help dd { margin: 0; }

	.card-privacy { background: var(--yellow); }

	.privacy-mark {
		position: absolute;
		right: 7%;
		bottom: 8%;
		display: grid;
		width: 94px;
		aspect-ratio: 1;
		grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;
		gap: 32px;
	}

	.privacy-mark i { background: var(--blue); }
	.privacy-mark b {
		position: absolute;
		top: 50%;
		left: 50%;
		width: 32px;
		aspect-ratio: 1;
		background: var(--orange);
		border: var(--line);
		border-radius: 50%;
		transform: translate(-50%, -50%);
	}

	footer {
		display: grid;
		height: 62px;
		grid-template-columns: auto 1fr auto;
		gap: 20px;
		align-items: center;
		padding: 0 18px;
		background: var(--ink);
		color: white;
	}

	footer strong { color: var(--orange); }
	footer p { margin: 0; font: 600 0.56rem var(--mono); text-transform: uppercase; }

	@media (max-width: 900px) {
		.site { width: calc(100% - 20px); margin: 10px; }
		header { grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr; }
		header > p { display: none; }
		header .brand { border-right: var(--line); }

		.hero {
			height: auto;
			min-height: 0;
			grid-template-columns: 1fr;
		}

		.hero-copy { min-height: 500px; border-right: 0; border-bottom: var(--line); }
		.hero-how { min-height: 410px; }
		.lost-section { height: auto; min-height: 290px; }
		.poster-grid {
			height: auto;
			grid-template-columns: repeat(2, minmax(0, 1fr));
			grid-template-rows: none;
		}

		.card { min-height: 260px; border-right: var(--line); border-bottom: var(--line); }
		.card:nth-child(2n) { border-right: 0; }
		.card:nth-child(n + 3) { border-bottom: 0; }
		.card:last-child { grid-column: auto; border-right: 0; }
		.card p, .card li, .card dd { font-size: 0.75rem; }
		.topic-list { max-width: 78%; }
	}

	@media (max-width: 560px) {
		.site { width: 100%; margin: 0; border: 0; }
		header { height: 58px; }
		header > * { padding: 0 12px; }
		nav { gap: 13px; }

		.hero-copy { min-height: 480px; padding: 24px 16px; }
		.hero h1 { font-size: clamp(1.75rem, 7vw, 2.5rem); }
		.hero-bottom { grid-template-columns: 1fr; gap: 10px; }
		.hero-how { min-height: 390px; padding: 20px 16px; }
		.hero-how h2 { font-size: 2.5rem; }

		.lost-section { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }
		.lost-copy { padding: 22px 17px; border-right: 0; border-bottom: var(--line); }
		.lost-section h2 { font-size: 2.5rem; }
		.lost-match { min-height: 230px; padding: 24px 17px; }

		.poster-grid { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }
		.card,
		.card:nth-child(2n),
		.card:nth-child(3n),
		.card:last-child {
			grid-column: auto;
			min-height: 235px;
			padding: 17px;
			border-right: 0;
			border-bottom: var(--line);
		}

		.card h2 { font-size: 2rem; }
		.card p, .card li, .card dd { font-size: 0.76rem; }
		.card-research { min-height: 320px; }
		.card-help dl > div { grid-template-columns: 70px 1fr; }

		footer { height: auto; min-height: 86px; grid-template-columns: auto 1fr; }
		footer a { grid-column: 1 / -1; padding: 10px 0; border-top: 1px solid #555; }
	}

	@media (prefers-reduced-motion: reduce) {
		html { scroll-behavior: auto; }
	}
</style>
